{
  "about": [
    "PIN-181 pantry scan eval. Photos live in eval/private/pantry/ (not in git); Commons files are downloaded by eval/pantryImages.mjs.",
    "expect: food that is clearly in the photo. A model item matches an entry when its English name contains one of the any_of phrases as whole words (plurals ignored).",
    "brand: true marks an entry that can only be named by reading the label or knowing the product, not from how the food looks.",
    "also_ok: things that are, or may be, in the photo but are too unclear to demand. Never counted as made up.",
    "never: medicine, pet products, cleaning products and the like. Listing one is the worst error.",
    "strict: true means the labels cover everything in the photo, so any other item counts as made up. On the other photos, unmatched items are only listed for a hand check.",
    "quality: the photo verdicts that count as right.",
    "Own-kitchen labels were drafted from the photos by Claude and checked by Yarden on 2026-11-26 (no bread in the spice cupboard)."
  ],
